    {
      "id": "82fbad41-29e4-415c-8159-2667d75b78c9",
      "name": "Overview Sticky",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -544,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## Grounded FAQ chatbot: answer only from your Google Sheet and log the gaps\n\n### How it works\nMost AI chatbots happily make things up. This one is grounded: it answers strictly from a FAQ you control in Google Sheets, so it never invents policies or prices. When a visitor asks a question in the built-in chat, the workflow reads your FAQ sheet, and a Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini answers using only those question-and-answer pairs. If the FAQ does not cover it, the bot says it will pass the question to the support team rather than guessing - and that unanswered question is logged to a separate sheet, giving you a ready-made backlog of FAQ entries to add. Either way a clean reply is returned to the visitor.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect Google Gemini (PaLM) API and Google Sheets.\n2. Fill a FAQ sheet with Question and Answer columns; add an Unanswered tab for the gaps.\n3. Open the chat URL and ask a question.\n\n### Customization tips\nSwap the chat for a website widget, Slack or Telegram, or split the FAQ by product."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
